{"type":"thought","data":"The code already contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" TRANSPORT_RE, the collect-report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verb, and _collected_path."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThis appears to be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a plan audit rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than an implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" review. I should verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan's claims against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the actual tree contents."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan describes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" future work, yet the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree already contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" collect-report and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"TRANSPORT_RE. This suggests"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan may be stale"}
{"type":"thought","data":" relative to the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" codebase. I am reviewing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan document for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consistency rather "}
{"type":"thought","data":"than verifying implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against it."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's claim that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the codex leg runs "}
{"type":"thought","data":"outside the verb may"}
{"type":"thought","data":" now be false, since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" collect-report already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exists. Auditing the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan document itself"}
{"type":"thought","data":" could still reveal "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contradictions even "}
{"type":"thought","data":"if the implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" has landed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will read the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file from disk to compare"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it with the inlined"}
{"type":"thought","data":" version. I need to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"verify specific claims:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the consumer-side guard"}
{"type":"thought","data":" landing in HemaSuite"}
{"type":"thought","data":" d1e73d53, exec lacking"}
{"type":"thought","data":" --report-file, GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shape, and grep claims."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The assumption table"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cites September 2026"}
{"type":"thought","data":" evidence, so those "}
{"type":"thought","data":"premises describe pre-implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" state.\n\nThe plan file is located"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at docs/01-plan/features/audit-report-docs-copy.plan.md."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will audit its internal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consistency and spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reconciliation, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verify its claims against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current tree."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI spotted three specific"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradictions in the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan: success criteria"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims 25 mutations,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but FR-6 and deliverables"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list 23; the marker"}
{"type":"thought","data":" text uses an ellipsis"}
{"type":"thought","data":" instead of the spec's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exact string; and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature slot stem uses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `<feature>` rather "}
{"type":"thought","data":"than the spec's `<feature>`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will read the full"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan file and the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify these against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the actual code."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regex ends with `\\s*$`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" immediately after `should=(\\d+)`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The actual code allows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" optional trailing tokens"}
{"type":"thought","data":" via `(?:\\s+\\S+)*`. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"This is a false platform"}
{"type":"thought","data":" premise."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's exact GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement is slightly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" wrong. The actual regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" allows trailing tokens."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Yet the spec's `INVALID`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" output still matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both patterns. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"spec also preserves "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the 2026-09-02 regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as read."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan was written"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on 2026-09-02, while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the audit is dated "}
{"type":"thought","data":"2026-10-24. The tree"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may have evolved since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" then. The GATE_RE discrepancy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a false platform"}
{"type":"thought","data":" premise, but it is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"not a must-fix because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec's required"}
{"type":"thought","data":" output still matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both regex variants."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI need to verify whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan's claims about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pre-existing code are"}
{"type":"thought","data":" accurate against the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" current tree. The auditor"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should check the actual"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE_RE and _gate_token"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementation, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" determine when that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regex changed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will read the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file, spec, key functions,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and SKILL.md to verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exact quotes and check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for missed known issues."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The document is v1.11"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with extensive prior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audit history. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the first cycle "}
{"type":"thought","data":"of a plan audit."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe auditor must avoid"}
{"type":"thought","data":" re-raising defects "}
{"type":"thought","data":"already fixed by prior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" versions. The mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is now pinned down:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the prompt requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 25 mutations, but FR-6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the deliverables"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list only 23 named-test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mutations."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe version history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at v1.9 also lists "}
{"type":"thought","data":"23 mutations, confirming"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the 25 count is a clear"}
{"type":"thought","data":" internal contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will verify whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the on-disk plan matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the inlined prompt,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and I have confirmed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that all 40 unique "}
{"type":"thought","data":"acceptance criteria "}
{"type":"thought","data":"are present."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's claim that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" seven of eight consecutive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycles skipped this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature lacks a cited"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command or observed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" output. This is a historical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" motivation rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a load-bearing assumption,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so it does not require"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verification."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-2 exit codes, the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" overwrite default, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and AC-1.6 property "}
{"type":"thought","data":"testing all match the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec. The plan's architecture"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim that `_collected_path`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" imports nothing from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the gate is also consistent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with AC-1.6."}
