{"type":"thought","data":"The on-disk plan FR-2"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line shows `COLLECT:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" OK|MISSING` without"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `CONFLICT`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe inline prompt "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contains `CONFLICT`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unlike the on-disk "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan. I will audit the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file on disk, since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quote spans and tree"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reads must match the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" actual artifact."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe workspace may "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be a snapshot. The inline"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prompt might have been"}
{"type":"thought","data":" generated from the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"file with substitution."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will inspect line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 46 character-by-character"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and compare more of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the prompt against "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the file."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe orchestrator re-derives"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the target document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the source file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path in each quote."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It does not score the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inline prompt text."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A finding based on "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the file would be incorrect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" relative to the orchestrator's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" view."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe quote span is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"confirmed present in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the file, so a finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" based on the file is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" valid. The inline prompt"}
{"type":"thought","data":" likely reflects an "}
{"type":"thought","data":"expected fix or manual"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transcription, not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the actual repository"}
{"type":"thought","data":" state."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will check specific"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suspicious spots rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than diffing the entire"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prompt. The success"}
{"type":"thought","data":" criteria count is identical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in both versions. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" scope marker uses `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in both the file and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the prompt, which conflicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with FR-3's requirement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for `<stem>`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe transport regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in `h-mad/scripts/h_mad_audit_gate.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rejects basenames matching"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_<stem>.report.md`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but Phase-7 reports"}
{"type":"thought","data":" use bare `<feature>.report.md`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This confirms the scope"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker's `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the requirements'"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `<stem>` are a real"}
{"type":"thought","data":" internal contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nv1.10 updated Requirements"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to use `<stem>`, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Scope still uses `<feature>`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The spec text prints"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `[H-MAD] <feature> "}
{"type":"thought","data":"gate INVALID`, while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan Requirements"}
{"type":"thought","data":" replace `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with `<stem>` and abbreviate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the parenthetical note."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This creates a direct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction between"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the specification and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec's `<feature>` placeholder is a deliberate design choice. v1.10 records this as matching the implementation plan, so the slot represents the transport stem rather than a parsed feature name. The apparent contradiction between Scope and Requirements is therefore resolved."}
