{"type":"thought","data":"An important finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was identified in h_mad_new_gate.py."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan omits that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot-judge exits "}
{"type":"thought","data":"2. It also says exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0 on any verdict, which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" could be misread as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" always exiting 0."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-3 transport refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prints counts `must=0"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should=0`. This violates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the invariant that "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a cannot-judge carries"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no counts. It exits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2, matching the cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit code. The key "}
{"type":"thought","data":"question is whether "}
{"type":"thought","data":"this case is modeled"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a cannot-judge or"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as an INVALID verdict."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit gate's INVALID"}
{"type":"thought","data":" token includes counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and exits 2. The new_gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern requires cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to carry no counts."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan incorrectly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" applies the audit gate's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" existing contract to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transport refusal instead"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the new_gate cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shape."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nStrict adherence to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the new_gate cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule would produce "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a token that `_gate_token`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot parse, since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE_RE requires counts."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The assumption table"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and FR-3 are the correct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract for this gate."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a must-fix "}
{"type":"thought","data":"because it could cause"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementers to drop"}
{"type":"thought","data":" counts."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe contradiction "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is a false premise about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the platform. The class"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule for this is build."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFixing the misleading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern citation would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not change the implementer's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code, since FR-3 already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" specifies the exact"}
{"type":"thought","data":" token shape. This suggests"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the finding should "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be classified as measurement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than build."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe class rule explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lists \"a false premise"}
{"type":"thought","data":" about the platform\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a build case. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" overrides the earlier"}
{"type":"thought","data":" measurement classification."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe standard audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" distinction is now "}
{"type":"thought","data":"being applied. Measurement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" means the published"}
{"type":"thought","data":" number is wrong but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the behavior spec is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unchanged. Build means"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the contract or interface"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is wrong and the implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" builds the wrong thing."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Correcting the misleading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern citation would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" change what the implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" writes, so this finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should be classified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as build."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-3 is unambiguous,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the strategy mis-citation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the only issue. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The transport refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exits 2, which violates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" new_gate's signal discipline:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" non-zero exit codes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mean FAIL or tool failure,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a verdict. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" makes the finding a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should-fix rather than a must-fix."}
