{"type":"thought","data":"A critical finding has"}
{"type":"thought","data":" been identified regarding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the feature slot."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe feature slot is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" parsed from the filename"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prefix before the `.report.md`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suffix. For a transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file like `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex.report.md`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the feature becomes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's definition"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of \"dot-free transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem\" is ambiguous."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It could refer to the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" entire basename, the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" portion after `audit_`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or the filename minus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extension. The plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" also states that transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" names have no reliable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature grammar."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe regex `^audit_[^.]+\\.report\\.md$`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" clarifies the ambiguity."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The dot-free stem is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the `[^.]+` group after"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_`, not the entire"}
{"type":"thought","data":" basename. This resolves"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether the feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" slot should carry the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prefix or the suffix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe feature slot should"}
{"type":"thought","data":" carry the `[^.]+` group"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verbatim. For `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex.report.md`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this yields `f_plan_cycle3_codex`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The gate marker would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" read `[H-MAD] f_plan_cycle3_codex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate INVALID`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uses `split(\".\")[0]`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which for transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" files yields the entire"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prefix including `audit_`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This differs from the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan's intended dot-free"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem. Normal audit "}
{"type":"thought","data":"documents parse correctly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because they contain"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a dot before `.md`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan v1.10 explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" states that `split(\".\")[0]`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" matches the design "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and implementation plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The specification requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `<feature>`. The regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" grammar separates the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_` prefix from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the dot-free stem, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"which excludes that "}
{"type":"thought","data":"prefix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThis is a plan audit,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not an implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audit. The specification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still requires `<feature>`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the plan v1.10 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"changed the wording "}
{"type":"thought","data":"to \"stem\" without updating"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec. The plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"itself is internally"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ambiguous or contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the specification."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec template "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`[H-MAD] <feature> gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" INVALID` already implies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the slot is the feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name. The plan's parenthetical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" about the stem is a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" clarification absent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the specification."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The prior audit v1.10"}
{"type":"thought","data":" approved this wording"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sweep as matching the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design and implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe prior audit v1.10"}
{"type":"thought","data":" concluded that no plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" decision changed. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" existing `split(\".\")[0]`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extraction is applied"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uniformly to all gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" markers, not only transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" files."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan treats the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem slot as intentional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and equivalent to `split(\".\")[0]`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for a dot-free name."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The specification's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `<feature>` slot is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the same code path,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but it never defines"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the slot as the stem."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Under Axis C, this "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is a restatement of "}
{"type":"thought","data":"an existing design contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than a new decision."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe phrase \"verbatim\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the claim that "}
{"type":"thought","data":"transport names have"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no reliable feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" grammar suggest the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem slot should copy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the identifying token"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as-is, including the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_` prefix. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would mean the feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" slot carries `audit_hnag_c28_agy`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than stripping"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the prefix to `hnag_c28_agy`.\n\nThe ambiguity is a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" real build issue. Two"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementers would "}
{"type":"thought","data":"write different marker"}
{"type":"thought","data":" strings.\n\nTests AC-3.1"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only check that the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line contains `transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file`. They do not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"verify the feature slot"}
{"type":"thought","data":" value. Both implementations"}
{"type":"thought","data":" therefore pass."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe ambiguity is classified as a build must-fix. The plan claims to specify the feature slot exactly, yet two readings of \"dot-free stem\" produce different marker strings. It also diverges from the specification's `<feature>` without updating it."}
