{"type":"thought","data":"indicates that the gate's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to extend follows. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The regex uses `(?:\\s+\\S+)*`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's cited regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits the trailing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"token group. It would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fail to match real "}
{"type":"thought","data":"gate answers like `gated=1`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The code comment explains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" these trailing tokens"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are intentional. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan assumes the regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stays unchanged and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only justifies matching"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the exact INVALID shape."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's regex is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an incomplete citation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the real regex. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"It wrongly presents "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a strict regex as current,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" even though the code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" comment shows that "}
{"type":"thought","data":"exact pattern was a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"bug that was fixed. "}
