{"type":"thought","data":" is sufficient proof"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because it exists verbatim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the source. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"trailing words may appear"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as prose after a closed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quote, which is acceptable."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The GATE_RE quote matched"}
{"type":"thought","data":" successfully, confirming"}
{"type":"thought","data":" backslashes survived"}
{"type":"thought","data":" intact."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe exact substring"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_slices.py"}
{"type":"thought","data":" slices SKILL.md` is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" being checked against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the source file to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"confirm it exists verbatim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without nested backticks."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe substring `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_slices.py"}
{"type":"thought","data":" slices` does not exist"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the source because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a backtick sits between"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.py` and `space`. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The filename alone is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" present verbatim. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" current quote therefore"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extracts only the filename,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which is valid proof."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe quote line is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"being parsed to see "}
{"type":"thought","data":"if the extractor could"}
{"type":"thought","data":" read from the first"}
{"type":"thought","data":" backtick after `›` "}
{"type":"thought","data":"to the final backtick"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on the line. That would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" capture the full span"}
{"type":"thought","data":" including the inner"}
{"type":"thought","data":" backtick, but it might"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not match the source"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file as a contiguous"}
{"type":"thought","data":" block."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe quote line is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"malformed. The filename"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is wrapped in backticks,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the trailing prose"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lacks a closing backtick,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so it sits outside "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the code span. The intended"}
{"type":"thought","data":" span was meant to include"}
{"type":"thought","data":" those filename backticks."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe trailing words"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are already in the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"bullet prose, so they"}
{"type":"thought","data":" do not need to be inside"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the quote marker. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extractor will still"}
{"type":"thought","data":" capture the filename"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a valid span. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" choice is between leaving"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the quote line as-is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or cleaning it up for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" clarity."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe report will remain"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unchanged. The done"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker was created "}
{"type":"thought","data":"only after the Python"}
{"type":"thought","data":" script verified file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" completeness."}
